      "topicWords": [
        "mobile payment",
        "smartphone",
        "daily life"
      ],
      "source": "authored"
    },
    {
      "id": "t_000224",
      "topic": "internet",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "zh": "社交媒体让人们即使相隔千里也能保持联系。",
      "reference": "In daily life, social media allows people to keep in touch even when they are far apart.",
