          "id": "kp1",
          "head": "social media",
          "zh": "社交媒体",
          "weight": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "kp2",
          "head": "allows people to",
          "zh": "让人们能够",
          "synonyms": [
            "enables people to"
          ],
          "weight": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "kp3",
          "head": "keep in touch",
          "zh": "保持联系",
          "synonyms": [
            "stay in touch"
          ],
          "weight": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "kp4",
          "head": "far apart",
          "zh": "相隔很远",
          "weight": 1
        }
      ],
      "hints": [
        "得分点：社交媒体 / 让人们能够 / 保持联系 / 相隔很远",
        "「保持联系」固定搭配 keep / stay in touch；「相隔」用 far apart 表达即可",
        "句型：In daily life, social media allows people to … even when they are far apart."
      ],
      "topicWords": [
        "social media",
        "keep in touch",
        "contact"
      ],
      "source": "authored"
